{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/httpdestinations\/httpdestination\/dropreports"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Property","modules":[{"name":"HTTPDestinations"}],"symbolKind":"property","role":"symbol","title":"dropReports","externalID":"s:16HTTPDestinations15HTTPDestinationV11dropReports11AsyncQueues0E5QueueVyAA14HTTPDropReportOy7FailureQy_GGvp","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dropReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncQueue","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"HTTPDropReport","preciseIdentifier":"s:16HTTPDestinations14HTTPDropReportO","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Encoding","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Failure","preciseIdentifier":"s:16HTTPDestinations12BatchEncoderP7FailureQa","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">>","kind":"text"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/HTTPDestinations\/HTTPDestination.swift#L187","fileName":"HTTPDestination.swift"}},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations","doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/HTTPDestination"]]},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"A report of each batch dropped without being delivered, in the order they are dropped.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/HTTPDestination\/dropReports","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"dropReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AsyncQueue","identifier":"doc:\/\/